flowchart TB
    Internet((Internet)) --> DNS[Public DNS / Custom Domain]
    DNS --> M365[Microsoft 365 Tenant]
    M365 --> Entra[Microsoft Entra ID]
    M365 --> EXO[Exchange Online]
    M365 --> SP[SharePoint Online]
    M365 --> OD[OneDrive]
    M365 --> Teams[Microsoft Teams]
    Entra --> MFA[MFA / Conditional Access]
    Entra --> RBAC[Groups / Least-Privilege Roles]
    EXO --> EmailSec[SPF / DKIM / DMARC]
    SP --> Access[Department Access Controls]
    Teams --> Governance[Owners / Guest Governance]
